{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_003_1000_p", "source_sha256": "cedcfe049834600f7cf63e9e729d993e4b5debccafc57c50f1aee7421f7be90d", "ja": "（ついに奈緒の、劇場初公演が始まる。\n宣材写真の時のこともあるし、様子を見てこよう）", "zh": "（奈绪在剧场的首次公演终于要开始了。\n考虑到拍宣传照时也有些小问题，还是去看看她吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_003_1002_p", "source_sha256": "4c2bb32946066e0ea9fff435b896be3a17a71189cae924eb3d45e3b130e720b2", "ja": "あ、いたいた。\nおーい、奈緒ー！", "zh": "啊，找到了。\n喂──奈绪──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_003_1003_037nao", "source_sha256": "10a5485bbd15b5235b2134918c12b1efedfc2350ffacd2f367f9c6b65d7e761c", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "啊，是{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_003_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "af53a5f0da6c2adb5bfeede47ad199012ca41164e811ad4ce806e63158227196", "ja": "どないしたんですか？\n私に、何か用事です？", "zh": "怎么了吗？\n找我有事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_003_1005_p", "source_sha256": "1846ac8d31e6cb1c07e1a75fa0c48b4f5440f7ee616e0114bd1c2f3bdacfcd92", "ja": "ああ。\nもうすぐ本番だから、様子を見に来たんだ。", "zh": "对啊。\n公演就快开始了，我来看看你的状况。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_003_1006_p", "source_sha256": "e0b3418e76d4ac8516d60673ef9ce76c42fdf58a1e3f34576e118c66952e5f1e", "ja": "奈緒こそ、ステージを見てたけど、どうかしたのか？\nもしかして、緊張してるとか……？", "zh": "奈绪，我才想问你怎么了，怎么一直看着舞台？\n该不会是很紧张吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_003_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "95a91db02ba8bda255ffdb57a179556bfaa229d87268811e528b1f4b2aa423f9", "ja": "あ～、ちゃいます！\n緊張はしてますけど、そういうんやなくて……。", "zh": "啊～不是啦！\n我是紧张没错，但没那么严重……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_003_1008_037nao", "source_sha256": "5c4cd7b8d8b5a9cc90cd3c72534046b04f4ca7822c460a6a8c3163029f3921b9", "ja": "私、ちょっと前まで普通の女子高生やったのに、\n今からここで歌うとか、信じられへんな～と思って。", "zh": "我只是觉得自己不久之前还是个普通的女高中生，\n等下却要上台唱歌了，好不敢置信哦～这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_003_1009_p", "source_sha256": "ac20535cbd1005128455d74ebb0350c4dea21bb09a238f6742adaac14a028be1", "ja": "なるほど……。そう考えると、\n確かに不思議な気持ちになるかもしれないな。", "zh": "原来如此……就这个角度来想，\n的确会有种神奇的感受呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_003_1010_p", "source_sha256": "1185ae5f8fc9fb90c88a612c5ea16a8f8310eb7442093ed449431c92eda69456", "ja": "つまり『アイドル・横山奈緒』の人生は、\nここから始まるってわけだ。", "zh": "也就是说『偶像‧横山奈绪』的人生\n将会从这里开始。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_003_1011_037nao", "source_sha256": "21baa2724d4ac75568361a9c58f6c03d250b7c5b71bd97a797a1058d210fd56e", "ja": "アイドル……横山奈緒……。", "zh": "偶像……横山奈绪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_003_1012_p", "source_sha256": "fe6015dc3dba33a30556a6f80e2b2d46819627e20f36d718e46c67afb7107d9a", "ja": "ああ。\nだから今日の初公演、絶対に成功させ……。", "zh": "没错。\n所以今天的首次公演，我们一定要成功……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_003_1013_037nao", "source_sha256": "922869e18243bb9b4f2a476e9bab6fdeba319ad60175222b02decf54a50ef9aa", "ja": "う……ぐすっ……。", "zh": "呜……呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_003_1014_p", "source_sha256": "70d75f777e27a8d02f7b0930ccd2e5c68883e2212cae2448bd70c796cf4e2d7e", "ja": "え……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_003_1015", "source_sha256": "ea29f3ac9981b0cccf2ea12d22511c56d3b9eb9c7c83a17ce27b3e394fe1e5b6", "ja": "ど、どうした？", "zh": "怎、怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_003_2000_p", "source_sha256": "e28eb9deda0a50acfeb2cec6863760e4c19a363958f8b588e90da550ea59ae97", "ja": "ど、どうしたんだ、奈緒？　もしかして、\n余計にプレッシャーをかけちゃったか？", "zh": "你、你怎么啦？奈绪？\n该不会是我那样讲给你太多压力了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_003_2001_037nao", "source_sha256": "5173f702c79c79ef74db6788aa13ac52aa53b136a3b7fd423e1dfe6c9c4f268d", "ja": "ちゃ、ちゃいます！　感激してたんですっ！\n私が、ホンマにアイドルになれるなんて……。", "zh": "不、不是啦！我是觉得有好多感触喔！\n想不到我真的当上偶像了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_003_2002_p", "source_sha256": "c8bc4de9876a87c6a6b08f42b0ebab56f9e01f28b9c011d1e179b22a12ee20cc", "ja": "奈緒……。", "zh": "奈绪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_003_2003_037nao", "source_sha256": "a85ffba94ca81800c383418d3a1c4672c28c6d15add388d0136898c6b1ea51c9", "ja": "これも、みんなのおかげです！", "zh": "这都是多亏大家的帮忙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_003_2004_037nao", "source_sha256": "345047d603ea417538f392b573e4639735903030652bfdfed2a9668dcd9267de", "ja": "私のこと「アイドルになれるで」って言ってくれた、\n近所のオバちゃん……。", "zh": "称赞我「可以去当偶像」的\n邻居大婶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_003_2005_037nao", "source_sha256": "eb9da181939ca440ef2803a46aa4f06f452e8b987f32519993323ed70b48c8ee", "ja": "私の夢やからって、東京行きを許してくれた\nお父さん、お母さん。面倒見てくれるアニキ……。", "zh": "允许我来东京追梦的爸爸、妈妈。\n照顾我的老哥……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_003_2006_p", "source_sha256": "e165543953bccf8689f4c6c3c22c8995b4cb20b886cdca365236f43dcf5db245", "ja": "そうか。\n大勢の人が、奈緒を応援してくれてるんだな。", "zh": "原来是这样。\n有很多人都在背后支持奈绪呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_003_2007_037nao", "source_sha256": "41de711eb6b54eb48a1d532c1e358ab23d63e06cd03406690d91ea6ec1f2828c", "ja": "はい！　それに、ここまで色々と支えてくれた\n{$P$}さんも！", "zh": "是啊！还有一直以来在各方面支持我的\n{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_003_2008_037nao", "source_sha256": "e3be1135b5b097145ad83b459166d0a5e3656fcfa56d5ff310031dcc04b6d1d3", "ja": "みんな……みんな、ありがとうなー！", "zh": "大家……大家，谢谢你们──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_003_2009_p", "source_sha256": "8702dcb191154aa9f338847e7abfe4d205a1b5d64660346cee5e638d0e8ad531", "ja": "はは。\nここまで色々と支えてくれたって、大げさだな。", "zh": "哈哈。\n什么在各方面支持你啊，太夸张啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_003_2010_p", "source_sha256": "5a5395a277b3259228a958e7a7fdfcf93efdc3343ce6d2e813b10eb9a15d06f2", "ja": "（もしかしたら……）", "zh": "（说不定……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_003_2011_p", "source_sha256": "4ae6f16cc52ea7fc762abadcfc9879a2c71853b2ce7199c142726d8767869a6c", "ja": "（奈緒はたった今、\n『アイドル・横山奈緒』になったのかもしれない）", "zh": "（就在现在这一刻，\n奈绪已经成为『偶像‧横山奈绪』了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_003_2012_037nao", "source_sha256": "fffe43e55932422f2054854c6c740cf5c467cf37e275d725c63401d589cc814e", "ja": "ううっ……ぐすっ……ぐすっ……。", "zh": "呜呜……呜呜……呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_003_2013_p", "source_sha256": "3e2d98ed2ead26f8a9c9fc74dd2a39a2450e0af7729af553eb1b9945d34766bf", "ja": "奈緒。気持ちはわかるけど、本番はこれからだぞ？\nその感動は、終演後までとっておいてくれ。", "zh": "奈绪，我知道你很感动，但是正式演出才正要开始哦。\n这份感动就留到公演结束之后吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_003_2014_037nao", "source_sha256": "96938662fdceff1548758ef77604eb37f55c86b6e667693b86037d734594ff08", "ja": "せ、せやんな！\n終わった後の方が、メッチャ感動するやんな！", "zh": "说、说得也是吼！\n结束之后才会更感动啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_003_2015_p", "source_sha256": "b4b224f535280edd75727cc793cb01c3d27752f84294e9caf3b96385e26e9b92", "ja": "そういうこと！\nそれじゃ、メイクを直してもらってこようか。", "zh": "就是这样！\n那就快去请人帮你补妆吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_003_2016_037nao", "source_sha256": "b7a7cb2a08b4416d18faf8bd7fda52975bf502e0053bdba05ee421a5d27d0b76", "ja": "あ！　そうやん、メイクしてもらったのに\n泣いたらアカンやんっ！", "zh": "啊！对吼，化妆师都帮我上好妆了，\n我这一哭不就报销了吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_003_2017_037nao", "source_sha256": "6bfb8f9c45fb6e260236ce818a7885e0e4eb8ae71718229e867ab9c5c13ca5b4", "ja": "すいません、{$P$}さん！\n私、パパッと直してもらってきますー！", "zh": "对不起，{$P$}先生！\n我现在马上去请人补妆──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_003_2018_p", "source_sha256": "53206a29afb60f6b8a6840cf0e4a65d02e11b0c6cc2a2dbcbc91a2117b044d15", "ja": "（ちょっとおっちょこちょいな普通の女の子から、\n『アイドル・横山奈緒』へ……）", "zh": "（从有些冒失的普通女孩\n转变成『偶像‧横山奈绪』……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_037nao_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_037nao_003_2019_p", "source_sha256": "dc07f61cc410a755754bfacb52d878682d61cc14468213619dcdff23b2b2c64b", "ja": "（今日の公演でその姿を、みんなに見てもらおう）", "zh": "（就在今天的公演上让大家见识你的蜕变吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
